      <title>捷豹路虎两年裁员4000人 目标节省17亿英镑</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260905/%E6%8D%B7%E8%B1%B9%E8%B7%AF%E8%99%8E%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E8%A3%81%E5%91%984000%E4%BA%BA-%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E8%8A%82%E7%9C%8117%E4%BA%BF%E8%8B%B1%E9%95%91/</link>
